---
const github = 'https://github.com/win5do/treefold';
---

<footer class="border-t border-white/10 bg-ink text-white">
  <div class="site-container grid gap-10 py-12 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.05em]">
        <img src="/favicon.png" width="30" height="30" alt="" class="rounded-[7px]" /> Treefold
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-7 text-white/50">并行展开，干净收敛。<br />为 Git worktree 与 Agent 协作而造的 macOS App。</p>
      <p class="mt-7 text-xs text-white/35">免费开源 · AGPL-3.0-only</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 text-sm text-white/60" aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/">首页</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href="/download">下载</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href={github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a class="nav-link" href={`${github}/blob/main/LICENSE`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">许可证 ↗</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
